  "_comment": "The Units of the User Agent (UAU): what acquires data from the physical layer and what delivers data to it. Acquisition and delivery are done by Units, not by AIMs. The seven Units of audio, speech and visual acquisition and delivery and of the delivery of a 3D model (AOA, AOD, SOA, SOD, VOA, VOD, 3OD) are those of the author (2026/10/09); the others (LiDAR, RADAR, ultrasound, offline map, text) are candidates, with the structure of the existing ones: acquisition and delivery of the audio, speech and visual Units have a User Command, those of LiDAR, RADAR, ultrasound, offline maps and text have none (offline maps and text are read from and written to storage). 'ports' are the Data Types a Unit takes from and gives to AIMs; 'status': code = the Unit has code in D:\\DI.",
